        "Description": "These people keep axing you for dumb favors, especially kai, and he bullied you in middle school, the middle school that his dad owned, which meant he didnt get in trouble. At the time, Nasuh was actually your math teacher who just sat there and watched you get bullied too! He would also always call on you with those really dumb tricky questions that nobody actually knew but were just asked so that he could explain. Anyways, you should kill both of them now.",
